### ============================================
### PORTFOLIO ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Get portfolio by ID (no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolios/1

### Get my portfolio (requires Bearer token from login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolios/me
Authorization: Bearer b1df4935-8f3f-4095-9396-60cb9f95f103

### Get portfolio for investor 2 (Age 35, has investment products)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolios/2

### Get portfolio - non-existent investor (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolios/99999